      "session_id": "chat-8df9fa6c2c014aee854d5bba01791d5a",
      "answer": "**No—WELL-0001 is not producing according to the latest data, as of 16 October 2026.** Its recorded status is “active,” but the latest inspection says **“Pump jack not moving”** (INS-0001-0203).\n\n**Last inspected:** 15 October 2026 at 09:45 UTC, by **Ryan Brooks**, using a drone. Effective temperature rise was approximately **3.2 °C** (INS-0001-0203).\n\nThe context note says it was shut in from 7 October for planned rod-string replacement, with return expected around 20 October; the work order had not yet been entered. No open repair reason is recorded (CTX-0001-003).\n\n**Unconfirmed disagreement:** Jake Morales says the well has been back online since 14 October, which conflicts with the inspection and shut-in note (CLAIM-0001). Can you confirm whether it has restarted?",
